sequenceDiagram
    %% ============================================================
    %% 7s TOMS — Instant Booking Sequence
    %% REQUESTED → RIDER_ASSIGNED (fare template matched)
    %% BR-005, BR-009, BR-029
    %% ============================================================

    participant P as Passenger (Flutter)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant FCM as Firebase Cloud Messaging

    P->>API: POST /api/v1/rides<br/>{pickup_place_id, destination_place_id, preferred_payment_method}
    
    Note over API: Booking Classification (BR-005)
    API->>DB: Check passenger suspended?
    DB-->>API: Not suspended
    API->>DB: Check strike_count >= threshold?
    DB-->>API: Below threshold
    API->>DB: Match fare_templates(from, to)?
    DB-->>API: Template found: fare=KES 200

    Note over API: Instant Booking path
    API->>DB: INSERT ride (status=REQUESTED, booking_type=INSTANT, fare_amount=200)
    API->>DB: INSERT ride_event (RIDE_REQUESTED)
    Note over DB: Trigger validates REQUESTED is valid initial state

    Note over API: Auto-assign (single rider online)
    API->>DB: SELECT online riders
    DB-->>API: 1 rider online (id_verified=true)
    API->>DB: INSERT ride_event (RIDER_ASSIGNED, metadata={rider_id})
    Note over DB: Trigger: REQUESTED → RIDER_ASSIGNED ✓ (Instant Booking path)<br/>Sets rides.status=RIDER_ASSIGNED<br/>Sets rides.rider_id<br/>Creates share_token

    API-->>P: 200 {ride_status: RIDER_ASSIGNED, rider_name, plate, share_token, version: 3}
    API->>FCM: Push → Rider: "New ride assigned"
    API->>FCM: Push → Passenger: "Rider assigned: [name] [plate]"

    Note over P: Passenger sees rider info + tracking

    P->>API: GET /api/v1/rides/{id}
    API-->>P: {status: RIDER_ASSIGNED, rider_lat/lng, ETA}

    Note over API: Rider accepts assignment
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of API: Rider has 60s to respond (BR-008)
        API->>DB: INSERT ride_event (RIDER_ACCEPTED)
        Note over DB: Trigger: RIDER_ASSIGNED → RIDER_EN_ROUTE ✓
    end

    API->>FCM: Push → Passenger: "Rider is on the way"

    Note over API: Rider arrives at pickup
    API->>DB: INSERT ride_event (ARRIVED)
    Note over DB: Trigger: RIDER_EN_ROUTE → ARRIVED ✓
    API->>FCM: Push → Passenger: "Rider has arrived"

    Note over API: Rider starts ride (explicit tap — never GPS inferred)
    API->>DB: INSERT ride_event (RIDE_STARTED)
    Note over DB: Trigger: ARRIVED → IN_PROGRESS ✓

    Note over API: Ride reaches destination
    API->>DB: INSERT ride_event (RIDE_COMPLETED)
    Note over DB: Trigger: IN_PROGRESS → COMPLETED ✓ (terminal)
    Note over DB: share_token_active → false

    API-->>P: 200 {ride_status: COMPLETED, payment_status: PENDING}
